  "agent_brain/ideas/_scratchpad.md": "---\nsummary: \"One-line idea seeds and unformed thoughts awaiting development\"\ncreated:\n---\n\n# Scratchpad\n\nOne-line ideas. Move to a proper file when they develop substance.\n",
